  "user_request_original": "Optimize a 20-layer planar multilayer stack on Al substrate with air incidence. Stack sequence: Cr | HfO2 | SiO2 | HfO2 | SiO2 | HfO2 | SiO2 | HfO2 | SiO2 | HfO2 | SiO2 | HfO2 | SiO2 | HfO2 | SiO2 | HfO2 | SiO2 | HfO2 | SiO2 | HfO2 (20 finite layers total). Initialize Cr at 15 nm, all dielectrics at quarter-wave optical thickness referenced to 550 nm. Optimize all 20 layer thicknesses in bounds [10, 300] nm using gradient_thickness optimizer with Adam-LBFGS hybrid. Wavelength bands: 400-700 nm (maximize absorptance), 700-2000 nm (maximize reflectance). Normal unpolarized incidence. Total layer count constraint: exactly 20 layers. Canonical user controls: wavelength intervals 400-700 nm, 700-2000 nm. soft objectives: high absorptance in 400-700 nm; low reflectance in 400-700 nm; high reflectance in 700-2000 nm. behaviors to suppress or avoid: high reflectance in 400-700 nm; high absorptance in 700-2000 nm. manufacturing constraints: total layer count not exceeding 20.",
